1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:04,850
Excuse me, how can I get to the science building?

2
00:00:04,800 --> 00:00:10,016
Go straight along this path and turn left at the library.

3
00:00:10,016 --> 00:00:12,616
Is it far from here?

4
00:00:12,616 --> 00:00:15,833
About ten minutes on foot.

5
00:00:15,833 --> 00:00:18,483
You cannot miss it.

